Description: Qualcomm capsule generation tools for UEFI firmware updates
 Utilities to create UEFI capsule files for firmware updates: firmware
 volume (FV) construction, capsule signing/generation, DTB root-cert
 patching, and related helpers, exposed via the qcom-capsule-tool CLI.
